    "body": "FWIW, the \"swappable\" concept is similar to what service workers do.  The browser is free to kill the worker thread even though there is a ServiceWorker DOM object alive.  The thread is restarted on demand, etc.\n\nIt comes with a big caveat for devs not to rely on global state, though.\n",
